					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Libellum furiosi <persName ref="p8312">Cochlei</persName> contra te scriptum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Wohl "Ein kurtze Replica auff die langen Antwort <persName ref="p495">Heyntzen Bullingers</persName>"; s. oben <ref target="file12051">Nr. 2004</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> mitto; si habes, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>remitte; nam nullum alium <persName ref="p8312">Cochlęi</persName> librum invenio contra <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>te scriptum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Gloriabundus est miles<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vermutlich eine Anspielung auf <persName ref="p19874">Plautus</persName>' Komödie "Miles gloriosus".</note>; <placeName ref="l300">Lucernanos</placeName> sibi conciliare <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cupit, quo maiorem invidiam tibi conflet.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Proscidit et in libro <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>contra <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> de sacrificio missę<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">1542 wurden <persName ref="p8417">Wolfgang Musculus</persName>' "Zwo Predigt von der Bepstischen Messe zu <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> auff dem Reichstag im jar 1541. am ersten und andern tage des Brachmonats gethan" in <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberg</placeName> bei <persName ref="p5529">Veit Kreutzer</persName> gedruckt <bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+M+7315">(VD 16 M 7315)</bibl>, welche 1543 in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> wieder aufgelegt wurden <bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+M+7316">(VD 16 M 7316)</bibl>. -Zu <persName ref="p8312">Cochläus</persName>' Widerlegung dieser Veröffentlichung s. oben <ref target="file12057">Nr. 2010</ref>, Anm. 23.</note> et <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglium</persName> et <persName ref="p2442">Oecolampadium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cum nostris ecclesiis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">O insulsum caput!</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Apparet in iis, quam sinistre <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>theologos veteres ex nativa malitia invertat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Verum melius ea per<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pendis quam ego, cui maior cognitio divinarum rerum et fęcundius ingenium <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad deprehendendum dolos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l834">Itali</placeName> et <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName> ex militia redeunt <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>catervatim; valde locupletes sunt; de <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> nostris nihil certi <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>audimus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p20225">Gallus</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> totum exercitum contra<pb type="edition" next="469"/> <persName ref="p8375">Anglum</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">König <persName ref="p8375">Heinrich VIII.</persName></note> ducit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Aiunt <persName ref="p8375">Anglum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>aufugisse in <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName>, exercitum <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName> subsequi, <placeName ref="l2122">Boloniam</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><placeName ref="l2122">Boulogne</placeName> (heute <placeName ref="l2122">Boulogne-sur-Mer</placeName>, <placeName ref="l3411">Dép. Pas-de-Calais</placeName>).</note> civitatem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>obsedisse, quę fere omnino diruta per bombardas<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Steingeschütze. - Vgl. dazu <bibl source="b550">Rozet/Lembey</bibl> 384.</note>.<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">König <persName ref="p8375">Heinrich VIII.</persName> hatte <placeName ref="l3545">Nordfrankreich</placeName> angegriffen und <placeName ref="l2122">Boulogne</placeName> lange belagert. Die Stadt fiel aber erst am 14. September 1544. Ende September zog sich <persName ref="p8375">Heinrich VIII.</persName> nach <placeName ref="l830">England</placeName> zurück. Anfang Oktober belagerten die <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> <placeName ref="l2122">Boulogne</placeName>, jedoch vergebens; s. <bibl source="b550">Rozet/Lembey</bibl> 188, 503, 505; J[ohn] J[oseph] <hi>Scarisbrick,</hi> Henry VIII, London 1968, S. 447f.</note></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quid futurum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sit, nescimus per hyemem.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Verum hodie quidam nobilis<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Unbekannt.</note> ex castris <placeName ref="l862">Helvetior<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>um</placeName> venit, quem alloquar; siquid, quod verisimile fuerit, dixerit, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tibi proximo tabellione scribam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4744">Pauli Fagii</persName> suppellex hac die na<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>vigio descendit <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12023">Nr. 1976</ref>, Anm. 5; 2007, Anm. 5.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Miror, quomodo <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensem</placeName> ecclesiam tam bene <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>constitutam deserere potuerit quave conscientia id fecerit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Fortassis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>habet certas rationes, quę me fugiunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino cum <persName ref="p8051">uxore</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="11"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>liberis<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kindern s. oben <ref target="file11884">Nr. 1838</ref>, Anm. 19.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> salutem ex me dicito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, 15. <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>octobris 1544.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">T<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>uus <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>vigilantissimo, praecep<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tori suo perpetuo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>colendo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
